      "body": "Successful merges:\n\n - rust-lang/rust#165032 (stdarch subtree update)\n - rust-lang/rust#165123 (Temporarily drop macos-26 jobs)\n - rust-lang/rust#165072 (Submodule update of rustc-perf)\n - rust-lang/rust#144090 (Make `IoSlice` and `IoSliceMut` methods unstably const)\n - rust-lang/rust#162342 (More stdarch regression tests)\n - rust-lang/rust#163909 (std: Test the exit behavior of `abort` and `abort_immediate`)\n - rust-lang/rust#164766 (Unstably introduce MVP edition migration lint `unmarked_unchecked_type_aliases` together with bikeshed attribute `#[rustc_unchecked_type_alias]`)\n - rust-lang/rust#164916 (CI: rfl: move job forward to Linux v7.3)\n - rust-lang/rust#164924 (Remove `TypeKind` from `rustc_codegen_ssa`)\n - rust-lang/rust#164969 (perf: avoid allocating HashSet in is_distinct check on small SwitchInts)\n - rust-lang/rust#165083 (Gate `z` inline asm template modifier)\n - rust-lang/rust#165087 (Fix flaky CI test `named_temp_file_new_creates_file`)\n - rust-lang/rust#161131 (Check associated const binding types)\n - rust-lang/rust#161418 (give next-solver's `evaluate_const` its own `try_evaluate_const` logic)\n - rust-lang/rust#164315 (make powerpc `Complex` ABI GCC-compatible)\n - rust-lang/rust#164476 (Avoid ICE on None from prepare_vtable_segments)\n - rust-lang/rust#165003 (follow up for global-alloc-reentry test)\n - rust-lang/rust#165020 (Bless mir-opt panic-abort tests)\n - rust-lang/rust#165066 (skip max_repr_align in Layout::eq_abi)\n - rust-lang/rust#165080 (Syntactically allow C-variadics in parenthesized argument lists)\n - rust-lang/rust#165081 (move `#[rustc_allow_const_fn_unstable]` attr check to attr parsing stage)\n - rust-lang/rust#165082 (Remove stability note from `rust_splat`)\n\n<!-- homu-ignore:start -->\nr? @ghost\n\n[Create a similar rollup](https://bors.rust-lang.org/queue/rust?prs=165032,165123,165072,144090,162342,163909,164766,164916,164924,164969,165083,165087,161131,161418,164315,164476,165003,165020,1650